class.description:
ItemDecoration is the port of [i]RecyclerView.ItemDecoration[/i]. Subclass it to add
spacing and drawn separators. Override [method _get_item_offsets] to reserve space around
an item (e.g. a divider gap) and [method _on_draw] to draw below the item views.

[b]Example[/b] — a horizontal divider:
[codeblock]
class Divider extends ItemDecoration:
    var color := Color(1, 1, 1, 0.2)
    var height := 2

    func _get_item_offsets(position: int, parent: Control) -> Vector4:
        return Vector4(0, 0, 0, height)  # bottom inset

    func _on_draw(parent: Control) -> void:
        parent.draw_line(Vector2.ZERO, Vector2(parent.size.x, 0), color, height)
[/codeblock]
